# TypeScript testing

`README.md` wins if this rule disagrees with it, except these commands, which match `.github/workflows/ci.yml`.

- Put tests under `frontend/__tests__/` (or another `*.{test,spec}.{ts,tsx}` file the Vitest include already matches). `npm run test:coverage` is `vitest run --coverage`.
- From `frontend/`, on Node 20: `npm ci`, `npm run lint`, `npx next build`, `npm run test:coverage`. `npx next build` is the typecheck. Do not add a separate `tsc --noEmit` job. CI does not run one.
- Tests are required for changed behavior. A bug fix includes a regression test.
- There is no numeric coverage gate. Do not add one.
- Use Vitest. Do not add Jest or another unit-test runner.
